Package: ldfreq
Type: Package
Title: Reproducible Lexical Diversity Profiles
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Ryuya",
        email = "komuro.4121@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Computes explicitly versioned lexical-diversity metrics from
    ordered pre-tokenized text. Provides canonical long-form results, bounded
    parameter profiles, multi-document adapters, and non-censoring token-length
    screens while retaining method, parameter, schema, and contract provenance
    in ordinary columns. The initial development release intentionally performs
    no tokenization, normalization, lemmatization, or public lexical-resource
    lookup. A byte-pinned internal TUBELEX aggregate is included only as a
    separately licensed development candidate and is not exposed as a user
    feature.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Ryuya-dot-com/ldfreq
BugReports: https://github.com/Ryuya-dot-com/ldfreq/issues
